---
/** Audio Overview — the roadmap's differentiator, honestly badged as in development. */
---

<section id="audio" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-20">
  <div class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow mb-4">
        Audio overviews ·
        <span class="bg-mark text-ink rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 normal-case">in development</span>
      </p>
      <h2 class="font-display max-w-xl text-4xl leading-tight font-medium tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">
        Listen to your research
      </h2>
      <p class="text-ink-soft mt-5 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
        Turn a notebook's selected sources into a spoken overview you can play while you work — the
        script is generated from the same grounded retrieval as chat, then read by a synthetic
        narrator.<a href="#fn-2" class="cite" aria-label="Footnote 2">2</a>
      </p>
      <p class="text-ink-soft mt-3 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
        The prototype starts with a single narrator. Two-host, podcast-style discussions are a
        later phase, so you won't find them promised anywhere on this page.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-card border-line rounded-xl border p-6 shadow-sm" aria-hidden="true">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Audio overview</p>
      <p class="font-medium">Sourdough, scientifically — overview</p>
      <p class="font-mono text-ink-soft mt-1 text-xs">Generated from 2 sources</p>
      <div class="mt-5 flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="bg-ink text-paper grid h-11 w-11 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="ml-0.5 h-4 w-4 fill-current">
            <path d="M4 2.5v11l9-5.5-9-5.5Z"></path>
          </svg>
        </span>
        <div class="grow">
          <div class="bg-line relative h-1.5 rounded-full">
            <div class="bg-ink absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-1/3 rounded-full"></div>
            <div class="bg-ink absolute top-1/2 left-1/3 h-3.5 w-3.5 -translate-1/2 rounded-full"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="font-mono text-ink-soft mt-2 flex justify-between text-xs">
            <span>02:41</span>
            <span>07:58</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
